# Camino - Cursor Rules
# Last updated: 19 Feb 2026

## Project Overview

Camino is a mobile-first business intelligence platform that turns raw business data (CSV/XLSX uploads) into actionable signals with AI-powered interpretation. The target user is a small business executive/manager who needs to understand their data without being a data analyst.

North Star metric: 1 upload (manager) + 1 view/week (any user)

Current phase: MSS (Minimum Sellable Service) - admin-in-the-loop model.
First customer: Locumate (Surge Singh, CEO) - Uses Zoho CRM, Zoho Desk
Goal: Reach billing decision by Mar 14, 2026

